    <string name="adfree_get_firefox">Install Firefox</string>
    <string name="adfree_get_newpipe">Open NewPipe on F-Droid</string>
    <string name="adfree_get_ublock">Open uBlock Origin for Firefox</string>
    <string name="adfree_honest">To be honest: Shield reduces ads a lot but cannot prevent them everywhere. The official YouTube app keeps showing ads because videos and ads come from the same Google servers.</string>
    <string name="adfree_in_shield">Built into Shield</string>
    <string name="adfree_in_shield_text">Shield uses the same filter lists uBlock Origin enables by default. It takes every rule a DNS filter can apply – whole ad and tracking servers. This works in all apps, games and browsers. Rules for single page elements or scripts only work inside the browser itself.</string>
