    <string name="adfree_youtube_app_hint">No app can make the official YouTube app ad-free – only YouTube Premium can.</string>
    <string name="adfree_youtube_text">Option 1: watch YouTube in Firefox with uBlock Origin. Option 2: NewPipe – an open-source YouTube app without ads and without a Google account, available via F-Droid.</string>
