    <string name="ai_daily_sub">Runs once a day in the background when online</string>
    <string name="ai_entry_sub">Daily AI check with your own Gemini key</string>
    <string name="ai_intro">Optional: with your own Google Gemini API key an AI checks once a day whether Shield works reliably and triggers a repair if needed (reconnect, update lists, self-test). Only an anonymous summary is sent: test results, error counts and settings – no visited domains, no IP addresses, no keys. The AI can never turn protection off. Note: on the free Gemini tier Google may use submitted data to improve its services.</string>
