    <string name="proton_connect">Connect with Proton</string>
    <string name="proton_quick_intro">Set it up once; after that Shield connects to Proton automatically every time. The Proton app does not need to run.</string>
    <string name="proton_quick_note">Tip: you can also copy the file\'s content – Shield detects it automatically when you come back. Proton does not let other apps read the Proton app\'s data directly, hence this short way.</string>
    <string name="proton_quick_step1">Tap “Connect with Proton” – the Proton page opens (sign in once).</string>
    <string name="proton_quick_step2">Under “WireGuard configuration”: platform Android, pick a country, “Create”, then “Download”.</string>
    <string name="proton_quick_step3">Tap “Open” in the download notification and choose “Shield”.</string>
    <string name="proton_quick_step4">Done: Shield takes over the profile, connects and checks everything itself.</string>
